orget that they did the same  thing earlier with Marcel Reiner  Bertolt and Andy and I plan to talk  about this at greater length in a theory  video that I'm working on right now that  will involve any and Arbonne so stay  tuned for that  we then see Falco overtaking Gabby in  their training by sprinting faster than  her for the first time  Gabby looks upset of course but we know  that Falco is trying so hard because he  wants to save Gabby from having to  become the next armored Titan and he is  prepared to do whatever it takes to  inherit the power in her place not long  after when Gabby confronts Falco about  why he is trying so hard to inherit the  armored Titan when he knows that his  brother colt is already set to inherit  the beast Titan meaning that Falco's  family will be granted honorary Merlyn  status anyway  Falco loses his cool and tells Gabby  outright that he is doing it for her  sake I thought that has showed some  great character development and it also  clearly demonstrates that Falco is  thinking about what being a shifter  really means he is no longer brainwashed  by Marlin propaganda we then see  preparations being made for the big  festival where the declaration of war  against parodies will be made  we learned that guests from other  countries will be present at the event  including dignitaries from the East  Union with whom our lay was at war less  than a month ago apparently the goal is  for people from all around the world to  come and see for themselves that the LD  ends in Marlay are not Devils like the  LD ins on parodies and so they are being  invited to witness the Marlin LD ends  declaring war on the Islanders at this  point  judo reveals that his family is  originally from another country and that  outside of Marlay LD ins are treated  even worse venom Marlay and this is just  insane and so hard to even imagine  knowing how discriminated the LD ends  are in marl a once again this hints at  the fact that if Titan power becomes  obsolete in the near future  LD ins will be in serious danger as it  seems that most of the world wants to  exterminate them we then jump to Willy  Tiber previously translated as Billy  Tiber but apparently  is the proper translation and he is  having a conversation with commander  Maga  we learned that this is all taking place  about one month after Willy and Magath  first met and Willy is now wearing what  looks like a badass fedora and he is  entrusted command of the military of  Marlay to Maga Willy says that he holds  the steering wheel of Marley but he  doesn't want to do it because it is too  heavy of a burden and this makes me  think what is Willy's plan if he doesn't  want to rule over Marley from the  shadows then how is he planning to  change that situation in the next scene  falco is shown talking to mr. Kruger  again on the hospital grounds  we learned that Falco has been passing  multiple letters between mr. Kruger and  his so-called family and Kruger tells  Falco that after the festival he will be  going back to his hometown this of  course reminds me of how Reiner and  Berthold kept talking about going back  to their hometown while they were on  parodies as Falco leaves mr. Kruger who  was obviously Aaron is approached by  none other than dr. jaegar grisha's  father and Aaron's grandfather dr.  jaegar tells Aaron that Falco's uncle  was a member of the LDN restorationist  s' and that in order to save their  family from being implicated in treason  Colt and Falco decided to dedicate  themselves to becoming warriors dr.  jaegar then begins to tell Aaron about  the regrets he has about his own family  and what he means of course is what  happened first to crush a sister and  then to Grisha and dr. jaegar then  begins to scream uncontrollably and in a  crazy twist we realized that dr. jaegar  is not a doctor at the hospital but  rather one of its patients driven to  madness by what happened to his children  in the scene after that we see a party  presumably the elite citizens of Marley  and dignitaries from other countries are  gathered here and the four child  Warriors are acting as servants for them  judo accidentally spills wine on a woman  who is wearing a traditional Japanese  kimono and rather than get angry she  pretends that she spilled it on her  selves so that you don't get in trouble  the kids are all surprised that instead  of hating him for being LD end the Asian  woman actually protected him  they say that she must be from his ool  which is presumably the name of her  country in Asia and by showing us this  woman clearly Yama is telling us that  while inside the walls on parodies the  so-called Asian clan is nearly extinct  clearly in the outside world that is not  the case  Willy then gives a speech where he  explains that he has found a solution  for ending the cycle of death and  violence that the power of the Titans  has brought upon the world and he says  that he will reveal this plan the next  day the following day a whole bunch of  outsiders pour into libero internment  zone and the festival begins during the  festival falco leads Reiner into an  underground chamber that is hidden away  from the public and there Reiner comes  face to face with the so-called mr.  krüger eren yeager aaron tells him that  he is glad that ryder was able to return  to his hometown and that's where the  chapter ends and there you have it for  all those people who kept asking why I  was saying that this was definitely  Aaron infiltrating Marley and that there  was no evidence that it's really him it  is now confirmed that it was Aaron all  along because Reiner clearly recognized  him straight away this was a crazy  encounter between two old friends and  current enemies and I really wonder what  will happen next I also feel like this  chapter might be giving us some  important clues about Zeke's secret plan  we see Zeke playing catch with a  baseball in one scene in this chapter  and we also see that Aaron has a  baseball and the baseball glove with him  in another seat is this a clue that  Aaron and Zeke may be secretly  communicating Aaron did say that he was  sending letters to his family but I'd  assumed that that meant Mikasa Armin and  the others however what if he was  sending letters back and forth to his  literal family his half-brother Zeke  some of you guys suggested this in the  comments to the last chapter of you but  I personally didn't  this would be the case since Zeke and  Aaron are technically enemies and I  didn't think Aaron would risk blowing  his cover by contacting Zeke but when we  take into consideration that in the last  chapter it appeared as if Zeke was  possibly listening in on the  conversation between McGough and Willy  Tiber the same conversation in which  Willy admitted that the Thai burrs are  secretly in control of Marley and if we  combine that with the fact that Zeke  encourages Reiner to follow falco to the  room where Aaron was hiding by  essentially saying it's fine there's  still some time before the curtain rises  and it starts to look like Zeke is  secretly working behind the backs of the  timers and maybe trying to unite the  forces of the audience on parodies with  the Warriors of Marley to potentially  take down the tiber family maybe Zeke  was the one who made sure that Aaron and  Reiner meet because he wants them to  join forces and take on the Tigers  together that would be a crazy twist but  I have to say we are used to crazy  twists by now the reveal from last  chapter that the tiber secretly control  Marley totally shocked me and now the  prospect of Reiner  Eden Arman Mekas Oliva and Zeke all  potentially coming together against the  common enemy sounds really intriguing to  me  maybe Aaron during his stay in Marley  realized that the ldiots here are  suffering he realized why Rainer did  what he did  and now he wants to make things right by  eliminating the forces that are  responsible for all of their suffering  in the first place  if the warriors joined forces with Aaron  and Arman we will have seven Titan  shifter powers facing off the Warhammer  Titan with Annies female Titan being the  only missing one I don't know if this  will really happen but I have to say  that this was another fantastic chapter  and along with the rapidly advancing  plot I also really enjoyed the world  building as we were introduced to  characters from other countries be sure  to tell me what you think did you like  the chapter what do you think is going  to happen between Aaron and Reiner will  they fight each other or make peace and  what about Zeke are we witnessing  secret master plan that he created  coming together let me know down below  if you enjoyed this video be sure to  leave a like to let me know and if  you're new to the channel don't forget  to subscribe and hit that notification  bell honestly the only bad thing about  this chapter which had such an amazing  ending is that we now have to wait for a  month to figure out what happens next  but overall I really loved it as always  thank you so much for watching and until  next time see our space cowboys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

